  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "行動微公益-為愛紀錄",
    "sub_ename": "ACTION OF MICRO PUBLIC WELFARE - RECORD FOR LOVE",
    "describe_ch": "微公益(Weigongyi)的本質，是以各種微小投入利他性的活動，用公益思維去生活與體察，亦可擴大延伸實踐社會群體公益。本課程係對應課程目標二、四之規畫，以「哈佛式個案教學」讓學員透過不同台灣經典紀錄片的觀賞，並做不同社會議題深入互動探討，培養學子關注社會公益議題的能力與思考，並讓學子親身投入周遭生活公益的微事，體驗執行「微公益」的活動。\n    學員們在培養微公益的執行體察流程中，教授以常用的手機拍攝記錄，並剪輯成紀錄片或照片專輯，再經由課程專屬建置之FB、IG、youtube等社群推播串聯，讓微公益資訊擴大，促進群體公益的效益。\n",
    "describe_eh": "The essence of Weigongyi is to use various small investment altruistic activities to live and experience with public welfare thinking, and can also expand and extend the practice of social group public welfare. This course is a plan corresponding to course objectives 2 and 4, and uses Harvard-style case teaching to allow students to watch different Taiwanese classic documentaries and conduct in-depth interactive discussions on different social issues, so as to cultivate students' ability and thinking about social welfare issues, and let students personally participate in the micro-things of public welfare in their surrounding life and experience the implementation of micro-public welfare activities.\n    In the process of cultivating the implementation experience of micro-public welfare, the professors shoot records with commonly used mobile phones, edit them into documentaries or photo albums, and then push and connect them through FB, IG, YouTube and other social networks exclusively built by the course, so as to expand micro-public welfare information and promote the benefits of group public welfare.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
