    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "讓學生熟悉社會公益議題的思考與批判，並投入公益實踐。",
      "describe_en": " Let students be familiar with the thinking and criticism of social welfare issues, and participate in public welfare practice."
    },
